## Use official Genie and Unity Catalog icons in Context menu

Context:
The Context → Metadata menu used generic Bootstrap Icons for Pages
(`bi-journal-richtext`) and Data Assets (`bi-database`). Replace them with
the official Databricks Genie and Unity Catalog brand marks, and rename the
Data Assets item to Unity Catalog so the menu matches product naming.

Changes:

1. src/front/config/menu_config.json
   Pages icon → `ob-brand-icon ob-icon-genie`; Data Assets → Unity Catalog
   with `ob-brand-icon ob-icon-unity-catalog`.
2. src/front/static/global/img/genie-icon.svg (new)
   Official Databricks Genie SVG for Context → Pages.
3. src/front/static/global/img/unity-catalog-icon.svg (new)
   Official Unity Catalog SVG for Context → Unity Catalog.
4. src/front/static/global/css/components.css
   CSS modifiers `.ob-icon-genie` and `.ob-icon-unity-catalog`.
5. src/front/static/global/css/sidebar-layout.css
   Sidebar sizing for brand icons beside Bootstrap Icons.
6. src/front/templates/partials/layout/_sidebar_nav.html
   Render `ob-brand-icon` without the `bi` prefix (same pattern as Settings).
7. src/front/templates/base.html
   Context subnav dropdown items support brand icons.
8. src/front/templates/partials/layout/_workspace_map_modal.html
   Workspace map items support brand icons.
9. src/front/templates/partials/domain/_domain_pages.html
   Section header uses the Genie brand icon.
10. src/front/templates/partials/domain/_domain_metadata.html
    Section title/icon: Unity Catalog + official UC mark.
11. tests/units/front/test_domain_pages_contract.py
    Menu + header contracts for Genie / Unity Catalog icons and label.
12. tests/units/front/test_backend_brand_icons.py
    Asset + CSS contract for the new brand icons.

