## Align Genie and Unity Catalog sidebar icons with siblings

Context:
The brand icons added for Context → Metadata (Unity Catalog, Pages) rendered
narrower than the Bootstrap icons in the sidebar because a local override set
their width to 1em. The labels therefore sat left of the Documents label. The
override is removed so the brand icons use the shared 20px icon slot.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/global/css/sidebar-layout.css
   Removed the `.sidebar-nav .nav-link .ob-brand-icon` override (width/height/min-width 1em) so brand icons inherit the 20px `.sidebar-nav .nav-link i` slot.

